## 🚀 Running Locally

### 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone <your-repo-url>
cd easy-decision-maker
```

### 2️⃣ Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### 3️⃣ Configure Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file:

```env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
```

### 4️⃣ Start Development Server

```bash
npm run dev
```

